# Butler Routes - Redridge recipes and patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans, schematics and formulas whose SOURCE is
# physically in Redridge Mountains, verified against the local Forever game
# data (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables). Most vendor stock sits
# with the trade-skill vendors camped in the southwest; Lakeshire's own traders
# carry the rest. Four more recipes drop exclusively from Redridge mobs. Every
# other Redridge-dropping recipe is a generic multi-zone world drop, and quest
# records carry no reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover
# those. Each step is gated to its profession; other characters skip it
# cleanly. First Aid and Fishing have no Redridge source, so they are stated,
# not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/redridge-recipes
title Redridge Mountains - Recipes & Patterns
levels 14-26
zone Redridge Mountains
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords redridge, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

